Light Match lamp profile data

The lamp profiles in this directory (*.json other than the schema files) and
the profile index are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may share and adapt them for any purpose, including commercially, as long
as you give appropriate credit. Credit is given by naming the Light Match
profile database and the contributors listed in each file by the nickname
they chose.

Submitting a profile to the database means you agree to license it under
CC BY 4.0. The Light Match code itself is licensed under the GNU General
Public License version 2 or later (see LICENSE in the repository root).

Imported profiles (imported/*.json) were generated from public databases
under the MIT, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0 licences. The
compilation is offered under CC BY 4.0 as above, and the data taken from
each source also stays under that source's licence: its copyright notice
and licence text are in imported/licenses/, listed in imported/NOTICE.md,
and every imported profile names its sources in provenance.imports. Keep
those notices when you redistribute the imported profiles.
